    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπορθιάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set upright,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰ ὦτα</span>
			<i>prick</i> the ears, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.4
			</span></i> : but mostly of the voice, <i>lift up at</i> or <i>over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλολυγμὸν τῇδε λαμπάδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινὺν τήνδε δώμασιν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1120
			</span></i> : abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γόοις</span>
			<i>lift up the voice</i> in wailing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1050
			</span></i>(lyr.).</div>
